{"action":"issue","adjudicationId":"no-three-in-line/g76-152-point-set","baseRevisionId":null,"evidence":[{"digest":null,"id":"dfc0cc40d41105292a119840dcdbe6f22860cf43","kind":"transaction","relation":"supports"},{"digest":"sha256:a470e4a9c0903097d9c860badaa8976cf32ed5336c154f11d8fad980d401f74e","id":"sha256:a470e4a9c0903097d9c860badaa8976cf32ed5336c154f11d8fad980d401f74e","kind":"judgment","relation":"supports"}],"issuedAtLedgerHead":"0b34ccfd75116b164feac84518acd4e8f61eb5ea","nodeId":"no-three-in-line/g76-152-point-set","nodeType":"claim","parentId":"root","reportRef":{"artifact":"report.md","digest":"sha256:2c1aed768dca909e7aa4d3b2be31da2d717c599e8cf692ae8755822942791931","section":"## Node: no-three-in-line/g76-152-point-set"},"revisionId":"sha256:76864191d97f36d99465ffa1a063a8eb65f9f34dc9c5dbcca28751f65d90e401","revisionNumber":1,"status":"active","subjects":[{"id":"dfc0cc40d41105292a119840dcdbe6f22860cf43","kind":"transaction","ledgerPosition":1}],"summary":"An exact computational certificate establishes a 152-point subset of G_76 with no three distinct collinear points. The verifier checks all 573,800 triples using exact integer determinants. It does not independently verify quarter-turn symmetry, but that limitation does not affect the certified no-three-in-line property. The encoded configuration is attributed to Achim Flammenkamp’s maintained database, while Robert is credited with reproducing and independently verifying the certificate; finer authorship history is undetermined.","title":"Verified 152-point no-three-in-line subset of G_76"}
